  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1001.02 Obtaining and Filing a License Application. Applications for licensure of manufacturers, wholesalers and distributors may be obtained from, and shall be filed at, the board office, identified in Ph 1003.03.\n\nSource. #8447, INTERIM, eff 10-14-05, EXPIRED: 4-12-06\n\nNew. #8708, eff 8-23-06, EXPIRED: 8-23-14\n\nNew. #12007, eff 10-22-16 (formerly Ph 309.02)",
